WEBVTT

00:24:56.708 --> 00:25:00.476
And you need to carry this app

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:03.934
so that we alert people quickly
if there's a problem."

00:25:03.958 --> 00:25:05.643
Is that --

00:25:05.667 --> 00:25:07.684
"We won't fire you if you don't come in,

00:25:07.708 --> 00:25:09.518
but if you want to come back to work,

00:25:09.542 --> 00:25:11.393
that's what you'll have to agree to."

00:25:11.417 --> 00:25:13.518
Is that a reasonable chance?

00:25:13.542 --> 00:25:15.542
I'm curious what people think.

00:25:16.375 --> 00:25:18.393
Is there any other way to get --

00:25:18.417 --> 00:25:19.934
Sorry.

00:25:19.958 --> 00:25:23.018
DA: I mean, again,
there is precedent for this

00:25:23.042 --> 00:25:25.726
in the sense that drug testing
works this way

00:25:25.750 --> 00:25:27.684
in many employment contexts, right.

00:25:27.708 --> 00:25:31.309
There are many roles where people
have to do routine drug tests